T0  Smith's own lines are the three motions.  Kill: any check off by more than 1e-12
   resistance circles touch the rim at the open point, reactance arcs meet the rim square-on: worst 1.3e-15

T1  Matched -> centre, lossless rim -> the shape's boundary, in V1 and V2.  Kill: any boundary point off by more than 1e-6
   triangle  centre V1 0.0e+00 V2 0.0e+00 ; rim to boundary worst V1 2.9e-02 V2 5.0e-13
   square    centre V1 0.0e+00 V2 0.0e+00 ; rim to boundary worst V1 7.6e-04 V2 5.0e-13
   diamond   centre V1 0.0e+00 V2 0.0e+00 ; rim to boundary worst V1 7.6e-04 V2 5.0e-13
   hexagon   centre V1 0.0e+00 V2 0.0e+00 ; rim to boundary worst V1 7.4e-05 V2 5.0e-13

